<body>
<div class="lf-page">
<div class="lf-cover">
<div class="lf-cover-logo">LF Academy · LF Academy</div>
<div class="lf-cover-grade">小四 · 第 37 堂 · Student Edition Handout</div>
<div class="lf-cover-title">SSPA 模擬考試 2</div>
<div class="lf-cover-subtitle">下學期期末 · 50 min · 滿分 80 分</div>
<div class="lf-cover-info">
<b>考試格式：</b>甲部 MC 選擇題 10題 × 3分 = 30分 | 乙部 計算題 6題 × 5分 = 30分 | 丙部 Word Problems 2題 × 10分 = 20分<br/>
<b>考核範圍：</b>L21-L36（Fraction、Decimal、Symmetry、因Multiple、四則、Area、方向、數據）<br/>
<b>SSPA 關聯：</b><span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🔴 模擬真實呈分試</span> 全真題型+計時訓練<br/>
<b>考試規則：</b>50min · 不可用計算機 · 步驟分必須展示 · 答案必須約至最簡
  </div>
<div class="lf-cover-row">
<span>Student Name：<span class="lf-line"></span></span><span>Class：<span class="lf-line"></span></span><span>Date：<span class="lf-line"></span></span><span>得分：<span class="lf-line"></span></span>
</div>
</div>
<div>
<div class="exam-header">
<h2>甲部：多項選擇題（10題，每題3分，共30分）</div>
<div class="sub">選出正確答案。每題只有一個正確答案。</div>
</div>
<div style="margin:12px 0;padding:10px 14px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#FEF2F2,#FFF8E7);border:2px solid var(--red);border-radius:6px;">
<strong style="color:#991B1B;">🎫 考試錦囊（SSPA 必讀）</strong>
<p style="font-size:11px;margin:4px 0;color:#1A1A1A;">
① 先做識做嘅Question，唔好卡死喺一條！<br/>
② 每題檢查單位（cm vs cm² vs cm³）！<br/>
③ 幾何題：圖中有標高就係高，冇標就用公式反求！<br/>
④ Word Problems：寫答句！唔寫扣步驟分！<br/>
⑤ 剩 5 min：檢查 MC 有冇填漏 + 單位有冇寫啱！
</p>
</div>

<div class="lf-game"><div class="lf-game-title">🏆 SSPA衝刺·限時挑戰</div><div class="lf-game-desc">模擬真實SSPA考試！限時作答，每題計分。答對率達80%解鎖「SSPA戰士」勳章！</div><div class="lf-game-action">⚡ 開始模擬考 →</div></div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">題號</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">分值</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">1</td><td>以下哪個是假Fraction？<br/><span class="mc-options">A. <span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">3</span><span class="fn">8</span></span></span>  B. <span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">8</span><span class="fn">3</span></span></span>  C. 1<span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">2</span><span class="fn">3</span></span></span>  D. <span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">5</span><span class="fn">5</span></span></span></span></td><td class="lf-qd">3分</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">2</td><td><span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">2</span><span class="fn">5</span></span></span> + <span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">3</span><span class="fn">10</span></span></span> = ？<br/><span class="mc-options">A. <span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">5</span><span class="fn">15</span></span></span>  B. <span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">7</span><span class="fn">10</span></span></span>  C. <span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">1</span><span class="fn">2</span></span></span>  D. <span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">5</span><span class="fn">10</span></span></span></span></td><td class="lf-qd">3分</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">3</td><td>0.5 + 0.28 = ？<br/><span class="mc-options">A. 0.33  B. 0.78  C. 0.6  D. 0.53</span></td><td class="lf-qd">3分</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">4</td><td>以下哪個數值最大？<br/><span class="mc-options">A. 0.5  B. 0.05  C. 0.45  D. 0.6</span></td><td class="lf-qd">3分</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">5</td><td>Square有多少條Symmetry軸？<br/><span class="mc-options">A. 1條  B. 2條  C. 3條  D. 4條</span></td><td class="lf-qd">3分</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
</table>
</div>
<div>
<div class="exam-header"><h2>甲部：多項選擇題（續）</div></div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">題號</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">分值</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">6</td><td>12 和 18 的 HCF（最大公Factor）= ？<br/><span class="mc-options">A. 3  B. 4  C. 6  D. 12</span></td><td class="lf-qd">3分</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">7</td><td>18 - (7 + 5) = ？<br/><span class="mc-options">A. 6  B. 16  C. 10  D. 20</span></td><td class="lf-qd">3分</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">8</td><td>L形由兩個Rectangle組成：A=5cm×3cm，B=2cm×4cm。總Area = ？<br/><span class="mc-options">A. 15 cm²  B. 23 cm²  C. 20 cm²  D. 8 cm²</span></td><td class="lf-qd">3分</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">9</td><td>小明用了零用錢的 <span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">1</span><span class="fn">3</span></span></span>，再用剩餘的 <span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">1</span><span class="fn">2</span></span></span>。第二次用了全部零用錢的幾分之幾？<br/><span class="mc-options">A. <span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">1</span><span class="fn">2</span></span></span>  B. <span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">1</span><span class="fn">3</span></span></span>  C. <span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">1</span><span class="fn">6</span></span></span>  D. <span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">5</span><span class="fn">6</span></span></span></span></td><td class="lf-qd">3分</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">10</td><td>面向東北，向後轉是面向什麼方向？<br/><span class="mc-options">A. 西北  B. 東南  C. 西南  D. 正南</span></td><td class="lf-qd">3分</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="score-box"><b>甲部得分：___ / 30</b></div>
<div class="exam-header" style="margin-top:12px;">
<h2>乙部：計算題（6題，每題5分，共30分）</div>
<div class="sub">必須展示計算步驟。答案要約至最簡。Fraction答案如為假Fraction須轉帶Fraction。</div>
</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">題號</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">分值</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">11</td><td><span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">2</span><span class="fn">3</span></span></span> + <span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">5</span><span class="fn">6</span></span></span> = ？</td><td class="lf-qd">5分</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">12</td><td>3<span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">1</span><span class="fn">4</span></span></span> - 1<span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">3</span><span class="fn">4</span></span></span> = ？</td><td class="lf-qd">5分</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">13</td><td>1.75 + 2.8 - 3.2 = ？</td><td class="lf-qd">5分</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">14</td><td>(24 - 8) × 3 + 12 ÷ 4 = ？</td><td class="lf-qd">5分</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">15</td><td>找出 24 和 36 的 HCF 和 LCM。</td><td class="lf-qd">5分</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">16</td><td><span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">3</span><span class="fn">5</span></span></span> - <span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">1</span><span class="fn">4</span></span></span> + <span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">1</span><span class="fn">2</span></span></span> = ？</td><td class="lf-qd">5分</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="score-box"><b>乙部得分：___ / 30</b></div>
</div>
<div>
<div class="exam-header">
<h2>丙部：Word Problems（2題，每題10分，共20分）</div>
<div class="sub">必須列出綜合算式和答案。步驟佔分，答案錯誤但步驟正確可得部分Fraction。</div>
</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">題號</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">分值</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">17</td><td>媽媽去超市購物：牛奶2盒，每盒$18.50；麪包3個，每個$8.80；雞蛋1盒$22.60。<br/>(a) 總共要付多少元？（4分）<br/>(b) 媽媽付了$100，找回多少？（3分）<br/>(c) 如果把找回的錢平均分給3個小朋友，每人可得多少元？（3分）</td><td class="lf-qd">10分</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:100px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">18</td><td>一個L形花園如圖：豎直部分長8m闊4m，橫向部分（接在底部）長6m闊3m。<br/>(a) 畫出花園的簡圖，標出所有尺寸。（2分）<br/>(b) 計算花園的總Area。（4分）<br/>(c) 如果沿花園外圍建籬笆，籬笆總長 = ？（即Perimeter）（4分）</td><td class="lf-qd">10分</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:120px;"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="score-box"><b>丙部得分：___ / 20</b></div>
<div style="text-align:center;margin:16px 0;padding:16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#DBEAFE,#93C5FD);border-radius:10px;">
<div style="font-size:18px;font-weight:900;color:var(--blue);">總分：____ / 80</div>
<div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--blue);margin-top:4px;">
      評級：A(70-80) · B(60-69) · C(50-59) · D(40-49) · E(0-39)
    </div>
</div>
<div class="warn">⚠️ 考試策略：先做MC（快）→再做計算（穩）→最後Word Problems（多分）。唔好喺一條Question上花超過5min！</div>
<div class="mn">🧠 應試Mnemonic：「MC先做快準，計算列步唔急，Word Problems要寫算式，單位步驟分都計。遇到唔識先跳過，做完返轉頭再諗。」</div>
<div class="lf-h1">考試後自我檢討</div>
<div style="margin:12px 0;padding:10px 14px;background:#FFFBEB;border:1.5px solid var(--gold);border-radius:6px;font-size:12px;">
<strong style="color:#92400E;">🎯 Learning Objectives Review — 完成本堂後你應該能夠：</strong>
<div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;margin-top:6px;">
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 辨認本堂所有Trap類型</span>
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 獨立解答🌱基礎題（100%正確）</span>
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 挑戰🌿進階題（80%+正確）</span>
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 向同學解釋本堂Mnemonic</span>
</div>
</div>
<table class="et">
<tr><th>#</th><th>檢討項目</th><th>學生自評</th></tr>
<tr><td>1</td><td>MC題有冇因為冇通分/Decimal點對齊而錯？</td><td></td></tr>
<tr><td>2</td><td>計算題有冇因忘記約簡/轉帶Fraction而扣分？</td><td></td></tr>
<tr><td>3</td><td>Word Problems有冇列出綜合算式？步驟是否完整？</td><td></td></tr>
<tr><td>4</td><td>時間分配是否合理？有冇Question唔夠時間做？</td><td></td></tr>
<tr><td>5</td><td>最常見的錯誤類型是什麼？（單位/計算/概念）</td><td></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h1">附錄：考後加強練習（S1-S18）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th>答案</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">S1</td><td>2/5 + 1/3 = ？</td><td class="lf-ans">6/15+5/15=11/15</td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">S2</td><td>0.75 + 1/4 = ？（統一為Decimal或Fraction作答）</td><td class="lf-ans">0.75+0.25=1.0</td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">S3</td><td>用了零用錢的 1/4 買文具，再用剩餘的 1/2 買零食。第二次用了全部的幾分之幾？</td><td class="lf-ans">(1−1/4)×1/2=3/8</td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">S4</td><td>計算：4.25 + 3.8 − 2.6 = ？</td><td class="lf-ans">5.45</td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">S5</td><td>SquareArea = 49 cm²。(a) 邊長 = ？(b) Perimeter = ？</td><td class="lf-ans">(a) 7cm (b) 28cm</td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">S6</td><td>12 和 18 的 (a) HCF (b) LCM = ？</td><td class="lf-ans">(a) 6 (b) 36</td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">S7</td><td>計算：80 − 15 × 4 + 20 ÷ 5 = ？</td><td class="lf-ans">80−60+4=24</td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">S8</td><td>Square有多少條Symmetry軸？Rectangle呢？</td><td class="lf-ans">Square4條，Rectangle2條</td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">S9</td><td>L形地皮由兩個Rectangle組成：A=8m×5m，B=4m×3m（右下角）。總Area = ？</td><td class="lf-ans">40+12=52m²</td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">S10</td><td>計算：3又1/6 − 1又5/6 = ？（要借位！）</td><td class="lf-ans">2又7/6−1又5/6=1又2/6=1又1/3</td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">S11</td><td>棒形圖顯示四種運動人數：足球35、籃球28、游泳22、羽毛球15。(a) 平均 = ？(b) 足球比羽毛球多幾%？</td><td class="lf-ans">(a) 25 (b) (35−15)/15=133.3%</td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">S12</td><td>某班 40 人，2/5 喜歡藍色，30% 喜歡紅色，其餘喜歡綠色。喜歡綠色的有多少人？</td><td class="lf-ans">40×(1−0.4−0.3)=12人</td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">S13</td><td>一面靠牆，用 48 籬笆圍Rectangle花園。闊 = 10 m，長 = ？Area = ？</td><td class="lf-ans">長=48−10×2=28m → Area=280m²</td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">S14</td><td>一枝筆 $3.50，一塊橡皮 $1.75。買 4 枝筆和 2 塊橡皮共多少錢？</td><td class="lf-ans">14+3.5=$17.50</td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">S15</td><td>Rectangle長 13 cm，闊 5 cm。用它剪出最大的Square，剩餘部分Area = ？</td><td class="lf-ans">13×5−5×5=40cm²</td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">S16</td><td>甲數的 2/3 是 24，乙數的 3/4 也是 24。甲乙兩數各是多少？</td><td class="lf-ans">甲=36，乙=32</td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">S17</td><td>一個Rectangle的Perimeter是 40 cm，長比闊多 4 cm。(a) 闊 = ？(b) Area = ？</td><td class="lf-ans">(a) 8cm (b) 96cm²</td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">S18</td><td>小明有糖果的 1/3 給弟弟，剩餘的 1/2 給妹妹，最後剩 8 顆。原本有多少顆？</td><td class="lf-ans">8÷1/2=16 → 16÷2/3=24顆</td></tr>
</table>
<div class="end-note">🪤 LF Academy · LF Academy · We don't teach math — we teach trap avoidance.。 · LF-P4-下-L37</div>
